        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.57
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        231,
        1927,
        1451,
        2103
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "2. Purposes of the Task Force. The Task Force shall review, examine, audit and make recommendations regarding: (1) the uses of City funding by CUNY, (2) the effects of open admissions and remedial education on CUNY, and on CUNY's capacity to provide college level courses and curricula of high quality to its students, (3) the best",
